sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant C as Cloudflare Turnstile
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Orchestrator
  B->>C: human check (when a sitekey is set)
  C-->>B: challenge token
  B->>G: POST /v1/session (origin checked)
  G->>C: siteverify
  G->>G: per-IP rate limit and daily quota
  G-->>B: single-use token, 60 s, bound to IP
  B->>G: WebSocket hello + token
  G->>G: verify HMAC, spend nonce once
  G->>O: open upstream session
  O->>O: reserve budget before any paid call
  G-->>B: welcome: session_id + resume_key
  Note over B,G: network drops
  B->>G: reconnect ?resume=session_id + resume_key
  G-->>B: resumed, same call continues
